For a long time, Yagditha has been creating all kinds of creatures with his magic and biotechnology. And the Shogoth are his best creation, since they can stay longer on the surface. But it is a cruel creation. He mixes the bodies of dead Pristonians with sea beings, reviving them and imprisoning their souls in those bodies. To keep them under control, they are always followed by the Sathla and Arhdyra.
Have mercy on our companions and give them the rest they deserve. Use this Quintessence Magic Stone; it will absorb the evil of the Shogoth's Manipulated Soul.

[Challenge Objective]

Obtain the Manipulated Soul by hunting Shogoth in the Abyss of the Sea.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
